                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="736-6e3a-d0b5-a1b0">Your Movement Phase</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Cost" typeId="a49e-3082-e2a6-e802">1</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="b77f-7548-840e-c086">Pick a terrain feature within 18&quot; of this unit, then pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Change-cult^^** unit that is **masked by illusion** or that has been destroyed to be the target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="2111-3ca8-61dd-a5f0">If you picked a unit that is **masked by illusion**, set it up wholly within 3&quot; of that terrain feature and more than 6&quot; from all enemy units.
If you picked a unit that has been destroyed, set up a replacement unit with half the number of models from the target unit (rounding up) wholly within 3&quot; of that terrain feature and more than 6&quot; from all enemy units.
**Designer&apos;s Note:** *Units can be set up in reserve masked by illusion using the Fatemaster&apos;s &apos;Long in the Planning&apos; ability.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="445d-f443-5448-e7ce"/>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
